<Routine Use="Context" Name="Lad_099_Controllers" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent Use="Context">
<Rung Use="Target" Number="24" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[TESTE test_bits.1 - LC21 FEEDFORWARD: soma a vazao de entrada FT11 na saida da bomba B421507 P21 (LC21.BIAS). Com test_bits.1 desligado o BIAS volta a zero (programa original).]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(test_bits.1) CPT(LC21.BIAS,INLET_FT11*LC21_FF_GAIN) ,XIO(test_bits.1) MOV(0,LC21.BIAS) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="25" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[TESTE test_bits.1 - LC21 FEEDFORWARD: ao ligar ou desligar test_bits.1, passa a LC21 um scan em manual com SO = saida atual, para a entrada/saida do feedforward ser sem tranco.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(test_bits.1) ONS(LC21_FF_ONS_ON) ,XIO(test_bits.1) ONS(LC21_FF_ONS_OFF) ][MOV(LC21.OUT,LC21.SO) ,OTL(LC21.SWM) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
